  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Katastrofberedskap MSB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Disaster Management Office and Swedish   Civil Contingencies Agency (MSB) - Disaster Management MSB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Akt&#xf6;rssamverkan inom katastrofberedskap mellan National Disaster      management Office i Botswana och MSB i Sverige. Projektet p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r till  december 2013 och inkluderar kapacitetsutveckling av NDMO f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka deras beredskap och respons vid naturkatastrofer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC-project between NDMO and MSB where the partners aim to build      capacity within disaster risk management and share experiences around best practices to reduce vulnerability in the event of a hazard. The  aim is to build capacity among NDMO officers so that they can make    more effective risk and vulnerability assessments.</narrative>
  </description>
